  "keyFeatures": [
    "Unified API for drug discovery, quantum chemistry, materials science, and biology",
    "Extensive model zoo with 60+ deep learning architectures (GCN, GAT, MPNN, AttentiveFP, Chemberta, etc.)",
    "Rich featurizer library supporting molecular fingerprints, graph representations, and 3D coordinates",
    "MoleculeNet benchmark suite with 40+ curated datasets",
    "Support for PyTorch, TensorFlow/Keras, JAX, and scikit-learn backends",
    "Chemically-aware data splitting strategies (scaffold, butina, fingerprint, etc.)",
    "Molecular docking and protein-ligand interaction modeling",
    "Reinforcement learning for molecular optimization",
    "Distributed training via PyTorch Lightning"
  ],
